From 12c692caf02198c5539039c189a22721ba512eed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Norris <will@biohack.net>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:47:16 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] Select native accumulator far word accesses

Rebase downstream 0062 onto the pinned native/far compiler series.
Original implementation, validation and review credits remain in the
source patch and investigation at wbniv/llvm-mos-65816 c3a53aecbc48.

Rebase preparation: OpenAI Codex CLI 0.157.1 (session source vscode),
model gpt-6-astra, xhigh reasoning effort; verified session
01a0e67f-298f-7a21-80af-06f867085f84.
